AcademySoftwareFoundation/openvdb @ 86b5ea9e98a3 (master, 2026-09-23): resolve
OpenVDB's own files through OpenVDB_SOURCE_DIR instead of CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR, so
OpenVDB can be configured with add_subdirectory() or FetchContent.

Proposal only. picovoxel, an unofficial community TypeScript/WebAssembly binding
of LEAP 71's PicoGK, builds openvdb 13.0.0 (7c03e1f0), which has none of these
references. PicoGKRuntime builds openvdb as a subproject, so a move to a
release that has them would hit this.

The defect. When OpenVDB is configured inside another project, CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR
is the parent project's root, not OpenVDB's:

  - openvdb/openvdb/CMakeLists.txt:15 includes
    ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/cmake/OpenVDBUtils.cmake, a hard configure error;
  - the Half.h/Half.cc sources (:571, :573), the ext/imath and ext/vcl include
    directories of the static and shared targets (:673, :677, :714, :718) and
    the ext/vcl install rule (:784) point outside the OpenVDB tree;
  - the ten VCL instruction-set probes in cmake/OpenVDBUtils.cmake
    (OPENVDB_COMPUTE_X86_INSTRSET_FROM_VCL) #include
    "${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/ext/vcl/..." inside check_cxx_source_compiles, so in
    a subproject the probe fails to compile and reports no instruction set,
    without an error.

The eight CMakeLists.txt sites arrived with 2433964511 and 60fa1b861d; tag
v13.0.0 has none and v13.1.0 has all eight. The patch replaces all 18
references with ${OpenVDB_SOURCE_DIR}, which the root project(OpenVDB ...)
defines: the same path in a standalone build, and the right one in a
subproject. It adds a pendingchanges/ note. doc/CMakeLists.txt has similar uses
and is left alone.

Output values: none; this changes only where the build finds its own files.

Checked (CMake 4.4.3, macOS arm64, 2026-09-27) with a minimal stand-in project:
a check_cxx_source_compiles probe that includes "${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/ext/..."
compiles top-level and fails under add_subdirectory; with the project's own
_SOURCE_DIR variable it compiles in both. A real subproject configure of
openvdb master, before and after, has not been run.

Target file sha256 prefix: openvdb/openvdb/CMakeLists.txt 6d4d4d3e717fa1b5.
Applies with `patch -p1 --fuzz=0` at the root of an openvdb master checkout.
Not applied by picovoxel's build; see upstream/README.md.

