--- /dev/null
+++ b/pendingchanges/cmakesourcedir.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+OpenVDB:
+    Build:
+    - Fixed configuring OpenVDB as a subproject with add_subdirectory(): the
+      core library's CMakeLists.txt and the VCL instruction-set probes in
+      OpenVDBUtils.cmake located OpenVDB's own files through CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR,
+      which is the parent project's root in that case. They now use
+      OpenVDB_SOURCE_DIR.
